---
description: Isolated campaign sources and builds
globs: evals/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Use pinned original upstream repositories. Read sibling checkouts without
rewriting foreign source or history. Campaign preparation may fetch sources and
build isolated checkouts under `.tmp/<task>/`. Keep useful configuration tracked,
not checkout copies. Report unavailable sources/tools explicitly. Analysis depth
does not imply that every build prerequisite was analyzed.
